52¢ to turn one row in a Microsoft List into a full account brief.

@sharepointfocus connected the Apify plugin to @MSFTCopilot  in SharePoint. One click on a row, and Copilot pulls company info, writes the brief, and updates the list.

Full walkthrough 👇

RT @sydneyrunkle: there is a TON of value in effective tool design

we tested 7 different toolsets against a relatively saturated browser use benchmark to figure out which toolsets were token/cost efficient

@Stagehanddev from @browserbase was the clear winner here! https://t.co/TEqsRICTRy

Open models were the first to do the sensitive work, like private documents and government data.

Now, with full zero data retention and more capable models, Ollama is making them the default for enterprises worldwide.

